# gui backend test (needs python3 + PySide6): clicks, menu popup, combo-box popup, dismissal, keyboard focus, modal dialog.
# Every step is asserted with WaitFor title, a failed wait makes the render (and make test) fail.
Window gui
Size 700x500
Title "Qt test app (PySide6, Wayland)"
Run python3 -I ${AUTODEMO_ROOT}/qtapp.py
WaitFor title "qt:ready" 30s
MouseMove 350 144 300
MouseClick
WaitFor title "qt:clicked" 10s
Caption "menu popup"
MouseMove 26 41 300
MouseClick
WaitFor settle 300ms 10s
MouseMove 66 67 300
MouseClick
WaitFor title "qt:menu=hello" 10s
Caption "combo box popup"
MouseMove 326 247 300
MouseClick
WaitFor settle 300ms 10s
MouseMove 42 312 300
MouseClick
WaitFor title "qt:combo=beta" 10s
Caption "dismiss: Escape, click outside"
MouseMove 326 247 300
MouseClick
WaitFor settle 300ms 10s
SendKey Escape
WaitFor settle 300ms 10s
MouseMove 26 41 300
MouseClick
WaitFor settle 300ms 10s
MouseMove 600 421 300
MouseClick
WaitFor settle 300ms 10s
Caption "keyboard focus is back on the window"
MouseMove 350 421 300
MouseClick
Send "hi"
WaitFor title "qt:text=hi" 10s
Caption "modal dialog"
MouseMove 346 334 300
MouseClick
WaitFor title "qt-dialog" 10s
WaitFor settle 300ms 10s
MouseMove 350 262 300
MouseClick
WaitFor title "qt:dialog-closed" 10s
Sleep 500ms
